      "id": "claim_84aed26892ad49c58375d48eb923d40d",
      "statement": "The session execution trace is exposed as the sixth method of the skillForge namespace: `SkillForgeGateway.lifecycle(sessionId)` returns a `LifecycleSnapshot`, and the browser client consumes it through an `unwrap()`-wrapped `ctx.remote.skillForge.lifecycle(...)` that is injected into `TaskManagerView` as the optional `lifecycle` prop from the pet-panel-capabilities child plugin.",
