    {
      "id": "claim_cd0cae7f052e484981d96785b1806c55",
      "statement": "The client re-groups the flat `LifecycleSnapshot.events` stream by turn at render time rather than trusting `snap.turns`: `LifecycleTimeline` walks events, advances a currentTurn counter on each `turn-start` with a defined turn, buckets each event under `ev.turn ?? currentTurn`, sorts turn keys ascending, and defaults to opening turn 1.",
